WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,010 --> 00:00:05,220
I couldn't save her back then and now

2
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:07,710
Do you still want me to turn a blind eye?

3
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,380
It’s all in vain that I have a heavenly cultivation

4
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:18,500
What's the use? Well, I'll stay.

5
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,450
I'll stay too

6
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:27,140
There's something wrong with that fake product.

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,900
There may be some martial saints who will take risks this time.

8
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:40,640
I can also stop you

9
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,240
You and Lin Lin stay here to help her together

10
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:45,230
As long as Wu Sheng takes action

11
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:46,830
notify me immediately

12
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,270
I'll come right away

13
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:59,730
Crush that fake Yun Jia’s head

14
00:01:00,130 --> 00:01:01,530
Do you want to test it again?

15
00:01:01,530 --> 00:01:02,730
Gu Shiyi’s identity

16
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:05,130
After all, it’s not necessary anymore

17
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:12,740
Give Yunjia's Wuji Four Divine Bows to her and don't need to test the others again.

18
00:01:13,910 --> 00:01:15,910
She has been homeless for many years

19
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:19,110
I don't want to rub words into her wounds anymore
